# [[ values.app ]]

[[ values.description ]]

Generated NestJS / TypeScript starter, owned by `[[ values.owner ]]`, for platform request
`[[ values.request_id ]]`. The sample orders API is a dummy application to replace or extend with
your service's business logic. The platform renders this application's Dockerfile and development
